You should get into the habit of checking this file for changes each time
you update your ports collection, before attempting any port upgrades.

20261015:
	sysutils/logstash8 now uses the Apache-2.0 OSS distribution. X-Pack
	features, including centralized pipeline management and X-Pack
	monitoring, are no longer included. The elastic_integration filter
	is also omitted. Review existing X-Pack settings and affected
	pipelines before upgrading.

	Logstash 8.19.23 requires Java 21 by default. Review logstash_java_home
	in /etc/rc.conf and custom jvm.options. The service now honors
	logstash_java_home and logstash_java_opts through LS_JAVA_HOME and
	LS_JAVA_OPTS; previously ignored overrides will take effect.

20260226:
	PHP_DEFAULT updated to 8.3

	The JAVA_DEFAULT is now bumped from 8 to 17. 

	dns/ddclient updated to 4.0.  The config file moved from
	/usr/local/etc/ to /usr/local/etc/ddclient

	cython was recently updated.  lang/cython is now the current version.
	if you need cython 0.x, use lang/cython0 aka USE_PYTHON=cython0

	net-mgmt/librenms updated and installation of mysql-client is now 
	a manual step.

20260225:
	nvidia-driver updated to 570 version.  You will need to update
	graphics/nvidia-drm-510 as well as x11/linux-nvidia-libs and
	x11/nvidia-driver
